'''Zombies''' are a type of [[undead]] [[monster]] found in [[Wraeclast]]. They are found in various environments; some will emerge from the ground when a player is nearby. Zombies are typically slow and have delays between their melee attacks. Some zombies have special effects that occur on [[death]].

__TOC__

